(4915879, 714471, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 7/6/5 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/7 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:8/8 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total: 6.56 <br/>Vote: 7 <br/> <br/>Remarks: I can''t easily <i>abstract</i> the image, which, however, doesn''t prevent me from appreciating it. The slow motion trails extend an ethereal quality to an animal usually evoking quite the opposite attribute. A gorgeous antithesis in a fine range of tones.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 7/6/5 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/7 Aesthetics/Technical:8/8 Presentation: 6 Total: 6.56 Vote: 7  Remarks: I can''t easily abstract the image, which, however, doesn''t prevent me from appreciating it. The slow motion trails extend an ethereal quality to an animal usually evoking quite the opposite attribute. A gorgeous antithesis in a fine range of tones.', '2008-08-27 17:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
