(4916903, 714692, 60862, '<td valign="top">An interesting image, but that curve that would otherwise be so nice is broken up by the sensor dust.  Remember: even in basic, you''re allowed to clone out sensor dust.</td>', 'An interesting image, but that curve that would otherwise be so nice is broken up by the sensor dust.  Remember: even in basic, you''re allowed to clone out sensor dust.', '2008-08-28 00:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
