(4918066, 713393, 95361, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but I''m not sure that it''s abstract.  Whether it fits this contest I don''t know...what I do know is that I like it.</td>', 'I like this picture but I''m not sure that it''s abstract.  Whether it fits this contest I don''t know...what I do know is that I like it.', '2008-08-28 15:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
