(4918265, 713165, 29011, '<td valign="top">I had a list of ideas and this was on it. I didn''t get to shoot it though but glad you did. The only such shot in the challenge. I like your take on it, would''ve liked it a bit more if the whites where pumped up some more.<br/>(no vote)</td>', 'I had a list of ideas and this was on it. I didn''t get to shoot it though but glad you did. The only such shot in the challenge. I like your take on it, would''ve liked it a bit more if the whites where pumped up some more.(no vote)', '2008-08-28 17:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
