(4919428, 714514, 90387, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph!! Nice depth and textures.</td>', 'Excellent photograph!! Nice depth and textures.', '2008-08-29 10:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919436, 714660, 30049, '<td valign="top">Certainly is different.  :-)</td>', 'Certainly is different.  :-)', '2008-08-29 10:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919440, 714576, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun abstract.  I''m generally a fan of narrow DOF and I like the detail of the rocks in the focused range.  In this case the impact may have been stronger to maximize the DOF and let everything really pop out.  JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a fun abstract.  I''m generally a fan of narrow DOF and I like the detail of the rocks in the focused range.  In this case the impact may have been stronger to maximize the DOF and let everything really pop out.  JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2008-08-29 10:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919441, 714480, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a bride, but this is far from being abstract IMO.</td>', 'Nice shot of a bride, but this is far from being abstract IMO.', '2008-08-29 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919446, 714685, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hooray for ink blots!  :-)  Ok, so I''ve seen a few of these before.   It works well for an abstract subject and you should do "ok" with it scorewise.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hooray for ink blots!  :-)  Ok, so I''ve seen a few of these before.   It works well for an abstract subject and you should do "ok" with it scorewise.  Good luck.', '2008-08-29 10:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919448, 714365, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cardboard?  It fits as an abstract, but there''s no tonal range at all in this.  Quite dark with a lot of middle-tone grey.</td>', 'Cardboard?  It fits as an abstract, but there''s no tonal range at all in this.  Quite dark with a lot of middle-tone grey.', '2008-08-29 10:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919452, 714694, 30049, '<td valign="top">A better inkblot than the last one I saw.  Works fine for an abstract subjectt, although a bit cliche-ish (sp?).  Good luck.</td>', 'A better inkblot than the last one I saw.  Works fine for an abstract subjectt, although a bit cliche-ish (sp?).  Good luck.', '2008-08-29 10:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919453, 714566, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks like a graphic...not a photograph.  Cool as an abstract I guess.</td>', 'This looks like a graphic...not a photograph.  Cool as an abstract I guess.', '2008-08-29 10:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919458, 714310, 30049, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didn''t get this to a true B/W...it is interesting with the waterlines/shadows playing over the dolphins'' bodies.</td>', 'Too bad you didn''t get this to a true B/W...it is interesting with the waterlines/shadows playing over the dolphins'' bodies.', '2008-08-29 10:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919460, 713631, 30049, '<td valign="top">Would it be politically incorrect to say those are some hairy legs for ballet shoes?!  :-D<br/> <br/>I like the bg choice as the diagonal lines in the brick work well.  The white point could be a bit closer to true white IMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'Would it be politically incorrect to say those are some hairy legs for ballet shoes?!  :-D I like the bg choice as the diagonal lines in the brick work well.  The white point could be a bit closer to true white IMO.  Good luck.', '2008-08-29 10:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919466, 714414, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting low-key shot (probably getting hammered on it being dark).  As an abstract I''m not sure it works because the subject is quite identifiable.  That''s JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting low-key shot (probably getting hammered on it being dark).  As an abstract I''m not sure it works because the subject is quite identifiable.  That''s JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-08-29 10:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919468, 713930, 30049, '<td valign="top">Heh.  Interesting, clean, simple, water (liquid based anyway)...probably will rise to the top in the challenge results.  :-)</td>', 'Heh.  Interesting, clean, simple, water (liquid based anyway)...probably will rise to the top in the challenge results.  :-)', '2008-08-29 10:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919471, 714149, 30049, '<td valign="top">The layout of the pieces is interesting.  Potential here...the image has a lot of middle-tone grey in it and could stand to be in better focus IMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'The layout of the pieces is interesting.  Potential here...the image has a lot of middle-tone grey in it and could stand to be in better focus IMO.  Good luck.', '2008-08-29 10:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919473, 712788, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fits as an abstract.  Doesn''t work quite so well as a true B/W.  It needs more contrast and a broader tonal range.  Wee bit noisy too.  Sorry.  Good luck.</td>', 'Fits as an abstract.  Doesn''t work quite so well as a true B/W.  It needs more contrast and a broader tonal range.  Wee bit noisy too.  Sorry.  Good luck.', '2008-08-29 10:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919479, 714692, 38032, '<td valign="top">nice dust.</td>', 'nice dust.', '2008-08-29 10:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919480, 713877, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice architecture type shot.  Not quite so abstract...nice B/W range however.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice architecture type shot.  Not quite so abstract...nice B/W range however.  Good luck.', '2008-08-29 10:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919506, 714414, 22748, '<td valign="top">This is a great image; I really like the dramatic light and shadow.<br/> <br/>However, I don''t feel it fits the definition of abstract art particularly well (though better than many in this challenge!) -- to quote from <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abstract_art" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">abstract art on Wikipedia</a>: "Abstract art uses a visual language of form, color and line to create a composition which exists independently of visual references to the world."</td>', 'This is a great image; I really like the dramatic light and shadow. However, I don''t feel it fits the definition of abstract art particularly well (though better than many in this challenge!) -- to quote from abstract art on Wikipedia: "Abstract art uses a visual language of form, color and line to create a composition which exists independently of visual references to the world."', '2008-08-29 11:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919528, 713499, 39679, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done B&amp;W.</td>', 'Really nicely done B&W.', '2008-08-29 11:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919548, 713191, 39679, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done!  You''ve done well in creating an abstract WITH something to draw the eye to.  The very sharp focus you managed really helps create a clean look to your image.</td>', 'Really nicely done!  You''ve done well in creating an abstract WITH something to draw the eye to.  The very sharp focus you managed really helps create a clean look to your image.', '2008-08-29 11:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919551, 714293, 39679, '<td valign="top">Well done in showing that "abstract" doesn''t mean that there can''t be something familiar in your image.  You''ve done a great job at controlling the background to really put emphasis on your subject.</td>', 'Well done in showing that "abstract" doesn''t mean that there can''t be something familiar in your image.  You''ve done a great job at controlling the background to really put emphasis on your subject.', '2008-08-29 11:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919555, 714230, 39679, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Very Escher but more importantly, it''s a very interesting and clean shot.</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Very Escher but more importantly, it''s a very interesting and clean shot.', '2008-08-29 11:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4919619, 714214, 69192, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but I think if you go in closer so that it was a little harder to tell at first glance that it''s a strawberry with a fork through it, it might say abstract a little better.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but I think if you go in closer so that it was a little harder to tell at first glance that it''s a strawberry with a fork through it, it might say abstract a little better.', '2008-08-29 12:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
