(4920712, 714510, 47316, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very cool. It has a sort of movement to it. Having the recognizable starfish on the strange background almost seems like a composite with the star pasted on. Arguably this might not be considered abstract but that isn''t affecting my vote. To me this would be interesting even without the starfish and it almost seems out of place, but it still works somehow.</td>', 'Wow. Very cool. It has a sort of movement to it. Having the recognizable starfish on the strange background almost seems like a composite with the star pasted on. Arguably this might not be considered abstract but that isn''t affecting my vote. To me this would be interesting even without the starfish and it almost seems out of place, but it still works somehow.', '2008-08-29 23:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
