(4921958, 712748, 83313, '<td valign="top">I feel like I got conked on the head an am just waking up to this view.</td>', 'I feel like I got conked on the head an am just waking up to this view.', '2008-08-30 18:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921969, 714320, 83313, '<td valign="top">Must be a meeting of obsessive-compulsives who must arrange the items on their desks just-so.</td>', 'Must be a meeting of obsessive-compulsives who must arrange the items on their desks just-so.', '2008-08-30 18:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921972, 712604, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a bit grainy and soft on detail. Your file size of only 79k suggests you had a lot more overhead and may have been able to get more detail into this entry. Check your JPEG compression settings before you save.</td>', 'Seems to be a bit grainy and soft on detail. Your file size of only 79k suggests you had a lot more overhead and may have been able to get more detail into this entry. Check your JPEG compression settings before you save.', '2008-08-30 18:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921974, 712723, 87898, '<td valign="top">I love the sharpness of the silhouette in contrast w/ the graininess of the background. You have great contrast too :).</td>', 'I love the sharpness of the silhouette in contrast w/ the graininess of the background. You have great contrast too :).', '2008-08-30 19:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921975, 714666, 87898, '<td valign="top">A bit grey, could use some more contrast.</td>', 'A bit grey, could use some more contrast.', '2008-08-30 19:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921976, 712639, 83313, '<td valign="top">I would have straightened the curve at the bottom, but I suspect you wanted it this way. Interesting textures and lighting in this.</td>', 'I would have straightened the curve at the bottom, but I suspect you wanted it this way. Interesting textures and lighting in this.', '2008-08-30 19:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921977, 714514, 87898, '<td valign="top">Good contrast. I can''t figure out what this is! :).</td>', 'Good contrast. I can''t figure out what this is! :).', '2008-08-30 19:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921978, 712934, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a metaphor!</td>', 'What a metaphor!', '2008-08-30 19:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921980, 713190, 87898, '<td valign="top">Could use a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Could use a bit more contrast.', '2008-08-30 19:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921981, 714650, 87898, '<td valign="top">A bit grey, but i love the diagonals.</td>', 'A bit grey, but i love the diagonals.', '2008-08-30 19:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921982, 713513, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is what appears to be a fair amount of mnoise grain, however that may jsut be the texture of the surface. It''s hard to tell.</td>', 'There is what appears to be a fair amount of mnoise grain, however that may jsut be the texture of the surface. It''s hard to tell.', '2008-08-30 19:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921984, 713529, 87898, '<td valign="top">Not very abstract but a good image.</td>', 'Not very abstract but a good image.', '2008-08-30 19:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921985, 713945, 83313, '<td valign="top">Neat shot and something that is common but overlooked. Nice job on finding interest in the commonplace.</td>', 'Neat shot and something that is common but overlooked. Nice job on finding interest in the commonplace.', '2008-08-30 19:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921986, 714398, 87898, '<td valign="top">This is great! I love it :).</td>', 'This is great! I love it :).', '2008-08-30 19:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921987, 713599, 87898, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if this is oversharpened or not in focus. You have good contrast though.</td>', 'I can''t tell if this is oversharpened or not in focus. You have good contrast though.', '2008-08-30 19:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921988, 714271, 83313, '<td valign="top">If I were a piece of meat being pounded on, I would not find it tender!</td>', 'If I were a piece of meat being pounded on, I would not find it tender!', '2008-08-30 19:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921989, 714211, 87898, '<td valign="top">Not enough black in the photo, makes it look a bit flat.</td>', 'Not enough black in the photo, makes it look a bit flat.', '2008-08-30 19:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921990, 714566, 87898, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!</td>', 'This is beautiful!', '2008-08-30 19:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921991, 713995, 87898, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more white in it to make it look less flat.</td>', 'Needs a bit more white in it to make it look less flat.', '2008-08-30 19:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921993, 714627, 87898, '<td valign="top">I love how you''ve placed the curves on top of straight lines.</td>', 'I love how you''ve placed the curves on top of straight lines.', '2008-08-30 19:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921994, 713701, 87898, '<td valign="top">needs more contrast.</td>', 'needs more contrast.', '2008-08-30 19:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921995, 713142, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the way the grating is reflecting the light, though my eye tends to just wander around the image and does not seem led anywhere in particular. That''s just me.</td>', 'I like the way the grating is reflecting the light, though my eye tends to just wander around the image and does not seem led anywhere in particular. That''s just me.', '2008-08-30 19:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4921997, 714323, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just isn''t grabbing me, wish I could tell you why, but i can''t put my finger on anything in particular.</td>', 'Just isn''t grabbing me, wish I could tell you why, but i can''t put my finger on anything in particular.', '2008-08-30 19:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922013, 713165, 81362, '<td valign="top">Your excellent abstraction first takes my imagination to chocolat bars on white kitchen counter tiles. The blurred shadows are indistinct, but help give a necessary (imo) three dimensionality to the image.</td>', 'Your excellent abstraction first takes my imagination to chocolat bars on white kitchen counter tiles. The blurred shadows are indistinct, but help give a necessary (imo) three dimensionality to the image.', '2008-08-30 19:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922018, 714665, 81362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful assemblage of curving forms. Nice to enjoy without feeling a need to puzzle over whether this is a plate or light fixture.</td>', 'Beautiful assemblage of curving forms. Nice to enjoy without feeling a need to puzzle over whether this is a plate or light fixture.', '2008-08-30 19:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922019, 714018, 81362, '<td valign="top">FAscinating repetition of rectangles, with just enough unexpected curves for extra interest. Echos of piano keys. Well seen.</td>', 'FAscinating repetition of rectangles, with just enough unexpected curves for extra interest. Echos of piano keys. Well seen.', '2008-08-30 19:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922021, 714203, 81362, '<td valign="top">Salvador Dali smiles over your work. 8.</td>', 'Salvador Dali smiles over your work. 8.', '2008-08-30 19:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922033, 714207, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and cropped to create the abstract lines and shapes. Something totally out of your control but boy I wish those clouds where not there it would''ve gained more abstract points ;) (no vote)</td>', 'Nicely composed and cropped to create the abstract lines and shapes. Something totally out of your control but boy I wish those clouds where not there it would''ve gained more abstract points ;) (no vote)', '2008-08-30 19:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922034, 714436, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very creative and original take on the ole CD reflection. Most definitely abstract. (no vote)</td>', 'Very creative and original take on the ole CD reflection. Most definitely abstract. (no vote)', '2008-08-30 19:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922042, 712719, 29011, '<td valign="top">Broken not coming to mind first when first viewing the shot. The zebra pattern really takes over my eye. For the broken concept perhaps a b/w bullseye pattern would''ve worked better? Still, it''s abstract as is.(no vote)</td>', 'Broken not coming to mind first when first viewing the shot. The zebra pattern really takes over my eye. For the broken concept perhaps a b/w bullseye pattern would''ve worked better? Still, it''s abstract as is.(no vote)', '2008-08-30 19:51:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4922044, 713235, 29011, '<td valign="top">Trying to be very open minded here and I''d be pushing it to the max to be thinking of abstract when viewing this shot. Still, this seems to be an interesting piece of art and you''ve captured a good angle on it.(no vote)</td>', 'Trying to be very open minded here and I''d be pushing it to the max to be thinking of abstract when viewing this shot. Still, this seems to be an interesting piece of art and you''ve captured a good angle on it.(no vote)', '2008-08-30 19:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922045, 714615, 29011, '<td valign="top">A butterfly wing design is one of my favorite abstract designs in nature. I think just a closeup tight macro crop of a straight on shot of the wing would''ve been just fine. Leaving the light as is though, being partially backlit, that looks great. (no vote)</td>', 'A butterfly wing design is one of my favorite abstract designs in nature. I think just a closeup tight macro crop of a straight on shot of the wing would''ve been just fine. Leaving the light as is though, being partially backlit, that looks great. (no vote)', '2008-08-30 19:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922049, 714469, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice minimalistic approach. This works swell.<br/>Reminds me of this artist''s photos, <br/>//www.pbase.com/shupiz/glass_works<br/>Hope you enjoy Shu''s gallery.<br/>(no vote)</td>', 'Very nice minimalistic approach. This works swell.Reminds me of this artist''s photos, //www.pbase.com/shupiz/glass_worksHope you enjoy Shu''s gallery.(no vote)', '2008-08-30 19:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922055, 714320, 29011, '<td valign="top">I have a big soft spot for coffee mugs LOL. I didn''t notice till after that you had a little black ring sort of accessory holding them together? As such the geometry as seen from the top , without any vertical perspective might have been better. (no vote)</td>', 'I have a big soft spot for coffee mugs LOL. I didn''t notice till after that you had a little black ring sort of accessory holding them together? As such the geometry as seen from the top , without any vertical perspective might have been better. (no vote)', '2008-08-30 20:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922056, 714553, 29011, '<td valign="top">Unlike some this is definitely one of those shot OOF on purpose. An abstract that''s perhaps deeply more rooted in concept than visually. I see something that reminds me of a robot or spider here.  (no vote)</td>', 'Unlike some this is definitely one of those shot OOF on purpose. An abstract that''s perhaps deeply more rooted in concept than visually. I see something that reminds me of a robot or spider here.  (no vote)', '2008-08-30 20:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922076, 714214, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice to have the strawberry sharply focused. Having the title "Fork" probably will work against you since that part of the image is mostly blurry background matter rather than where the eye easily lands. I suspect that  completely black strawberry, existing as a nearly pure triangle with curved wide end, might have fit better in a challenge calling for "abstract" images.</td>', 'Nice to have the strawberry sharply focused. Having the title "Fork" probably will work against you since that part of the image is mostly blurry background matter rather than where the eye easily lands. I suspect that  completely black strawberry, existing as a nearly pure triangle with curved wide end, might have fit better in a challenge calling for "abstract" images.', '2008-08-30 20:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922079, 713192, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting of the black microphone, which would have been easy to accidentlly lose in the dark background. Although these objects may be symbolic of night life, that degree of abstraction depends too much on the title for my taste.</td>', 'Nice lighting of the black microphone, which would have been easy to accidentlly lose in the dark background. Although these objects may be symbolic of night life, that degree of abstraction depends too much on the title for my taste.', '2008-08-30 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922085, 713934, 81362, '<td valign="top">Interesting chess pieces, quite different than the usual. I would suggest playing with a slightly wider crop for a little breathing room, and a smaller apeture for a bit more depth of field. This may not score very well since the objects draw the eye rather than the shapes or forms independently, and the abstract idea expressed in the title is not what comes to mind when just looking at the image.</td>', 'Interesting chess pieces, quite different than the usual. I would suggest playing with a slightly wider crop for a little breathing room, and a smaller apeture for a bit more depth of field. This may not score very well since the objects draw the eye rather than the shapes or forms independently, and the abstract idea expressed in the title is not what comes to mind when just looking at the image.', '2008-08-30 20:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922091, 714111, 81362, '<td valign="top">A circle more sharply defined would have helped the "abstract" aspect more. However, it does echo the Cheshire Cat, gradually vanishing right before Alice.</td>', 'A circle more sharply defined would have helped the "abstract" aspect more. However, it does echo the Cheshire Cat, gradually vanishing right before Alice.', '2008-08-30 20:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922095, 713111, 81362, '<td valign="top">With a different title and with a square crop eliminating part of the right hand side, I would have been happy letting my eye extract from somewhat abstract shapes a double deck subway train heading into the lower left hand corner. The title just makes me want to have the image sharply in focus so I can appreciate the abyss better.</td>', 'With a different title and with a square crop eliminating part of the right hand side, I would have been happy letting my eye extract from somewhat abstract shapes a double deck subway train heading into the lower left hand corner. The title just makes me want to have the image sharply in focus so I can appreciate the abyss better.', '2008-08-30 20:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922114, 714100, 81362, '<td valign="top">If I scroll the image up to imitate a square crop that eliminates the upper part of the image, I find a nicer balance between the in focus lower left hand corner and the remainder of the image, with the light diagonal line (?blade) setting off a sparkling region from a darker region. As displayed, the top part is so busy and blurred that it is hard to enjoy the rest.</td>', 'If I scroll the image up to imitate a square crop that eliminates the upper part of the image, I find a nicer balance between the in focus lower left hand corner and the remainder of the image, with the light diagonal line (?blade) setting off a sparkling region from a darker region. As displayed, the top part is so busy and blurred that it is hard to enjoy the rest.', '2008-08-30 20:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922117, 712420, 81362, '<td valign="top">The large beetle is nicely focused, and the battle makes an interesting macro, but I have a very hard time figuring out how to consider this abstract.</td>', 'The large beetle is nicely focused, and the battle makes an interesting macro, but I have a very hard time figuring out how to consider this abstract.', '2008-08-30 20:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922119, 712934, 81362, '<td valign="top">Crop away the tree and the upper bit of sky to have an abstract diagonal shaft of light and dark. Keep the tree and have an interesting perspective of two non-abtract objects. Yes, a cylidrical shaft can have phallic connotations, but I suspect depending on the title so heavily will not be rewarded very well in an "abstract" challenge.</td>', 'Crop away the tree and the upper bit of sky to have an abstract diagonal shaft of light and dark. Keep the tree and have an interesting perspective of two non-abtract objects. Yes, a cylidrical shaft can have phallic connotations, but I suspect depending on the title so heavily will not be rewarded very well in an "abstract" challenge.', '2008-08-30 20:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922120, 714553, 81362, '<td valign="top">First instinct was low score because the blurry shapes just wouldn''t gel into anything my eyes could consider interesting. On return, the thumbnail is a big help in making the "mouth" and multiple "eyes" easier to detect, although rather disturbing. Bumping up a couple of points.</td>', 'First instinct was low score because the blurry shapes just wouldn''t gel into anything my eyes could consider interesting. On return, the thumbnail is a big help in making the "mouth" and multiple "eyes" easier to detect, although rather disturbing. Bumping up a couple of points.', '2008-08-30 20:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922126, 713994, 81362, '<td valign="top">Fun image. My eye enjoys exploring around this convoluted visual playground of interesting shapes. That makes it abstract enough for me to rate it highly in this challenge.</td>', 'Fun image. My eye enjoys exploring around this convoluted visual playground of interesting shapes. That makes it abstract enough for me to rate it highly in this challenge.', '2008-08-30 21:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922127, 713290, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sky high view of an abstract river delta on a metallic planet. The rivers of condensation have been converted nicely into a science fiction landscape. Nice stimulation of imagination.</td>', 'Sky high view of an abstract river delta on a metallic planet. The rivers of condensation have been converted nicely into a science fiction landscape. Nice stimulation of imagination.', '2008-08-30 21:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922134, 714472, 81362, '<td valign="top">Extra point for humor.</td>', 'Extra point for humor.', '2008-08-30 21:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922135, 714137, 81362, '<td valign="top">Great find, well seen and well executed.</td>', 'Great find, well seen and well executed.', '2008-08-30 21:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922137, 713384, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like the balence of this composition.</td>', 'I like the balence of this composition.', '2008-08-30 21:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922139, 713226, 81362, '<td valign="top">Strong diagonals with good contrast betwen broad shadows and skinny railings. This works will in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Strong diagonals with good contrast betwen broad shadows and skinny railings. This works will in B&W.', '2008-08-30 21:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922141, 714542, 81362, '<td valign="top">The gradual transiton of grey tones across the dark tranbles adds interest, and the bright white triangles give a good rhythm across the image.</td>', 'The gradual transiton of grey tones across the dark tranbles adds interest, and the bright white triangles give a good rhythm across the image.', '2008-08-30 21:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922161, 714210, 81362, '<td valign="top">NIce spiral and enjoyable contrast between bright and dark.</td>', 'NIce spiral and enjoyable contrast between bright and dark.', '2008-08-30 21:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922165, 713930, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very nice simplicity, sharp and almost metallic. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice simplicity, sharp and almost metallic. Good job.', '2008-08-30 21:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922238, 714109, 81362, '<td valign="top">Hope this is not in earthquate country. Diagonals and linear shadows play wll agains the sphere. The image lends itself to a lot of alternate approaches to cropping, so I suspect you had some fund getting it to this point.</td>', 'Hope this is not in earthquate country. Diagonals and linear shadows play wll agains the sphere. The image lends itself to a lot of alternate approaches to cropping, so I suspect you had some fund getting it to this point.', '2008-08-30 22:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922239, 714302, 81362, '<td valign="top">Love the title. Very lively image.</td>', 'Love the title. Very lively image.', '2008-08-30 22:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922240, 713664, 81362, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t that make a fun inner lining for an updated capitol building dome. Just enough science fiction feel to stirr a lot of thoughts.</td>', 'Wouldn''t that make a fun inner lining for an updated capitol building dome. Just enough science fiction feel to stirr a lot of thoughts.', '2008-08-30 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922241, 714612, 81362, '<td valign="top">No argument with this being abstract. Bit of a zen feeling to it.</td>', 'No argument with this being abstract. Bit of a zen feeling to it.', '2008-08-30 22:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922242, 714566, 81362, '<td valign="top">Extravagant swirls, deserving of a framed display.</td>', 'Extravagant swirls, deserving of a framed display.', '2008-08-30 22:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922244, 714674, 81362, '<td valign="top">The rippling texture looks like canvas with the essence of forest painted along with the clouds. Shame on anyone complaining that this is "blurred".</td>', 'The rippling texture looks like canvas with the essence of forest painted along with the clouds. Shame on anyone complaining that this is "blurred".', '2008-08-30 22:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922249, 714404, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and light. The edges seem soft and the background shows some grain or texture. Part of me likes it this way, and part of me would like to see it with more dramatic transitions.</td>', 'Nice shapes and light. The edges seem soft and the background shows some grain or texture. Part of me likes it this way, and part of me would like to see it with more dramatic transitions.', '2008-08-30 22:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922251, 714617, 81362, '<td valign="top">Immaginative title. Will be interested in hearing how you did this.</td>', 'Immaginative title. Will be interested in hearing how you did this.', '2008-08-30 22:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922255, 714377, 81362, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t grab my attention well. If the various circles and curves could be more well defined, it would take less effort to appreciate their nested and intersecting patterns. Maybe the broad white border dilutes what little contrast is there.</td>', 'Doesn''t grab my attention well. If the various circles and curves could be more well defined, it would take less effort to appreciate their nested and intersecting patterns. Maybe the broad white border dilutes what little contrast is there.', '2008-08-30 22:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922256, 714449, 81362, '<td valign="top">Clever to flip the image. Good side light and fun choice of title.</td>', 'Clever to flip the image. Good side light and fun choice of title.', '2008-08-30 22:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922261, 713344, 81362, '<td valign="top">Others might have moved to eliminate the blakc shadow in the middle. It would be interesting to hear your thoughts that led you to put it there. Bubbles nicely captured and interestinly with more uniform distribution than commnly seen.</td>', 'Others might have moved to eliminate the blakc shadow in the middle. It would be interesting to hear your thoughts that led you to put it there. Bubbles nicely captured and interestinly with more uniform distribution than commnly seen.', '2008-08-30 22:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922263, 714417, 81362, '<td valign="top">The central dark area reminds me of a planetarium dome. Non-uniform edges to the circular structure add an unexpectedly dynamic feeling.</td>', 'The central dark area reminds me of a planetarium dome. Non-uniform edges to the circular structure add an unexpectedly dynamic feeling.', '2008-08-30 22:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922264, 714236, 81362, '<td valign="top">Your choice of conversion highlights the textures nicely.</td>', 'Your choice of conversion highlights the textures nicely.', '2008-08-30 22:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922270, 714326, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice but less abstract feeling than ideal. The current version is a good detail study of a zebra. The abstract pattern aspect might feel stronger if the original would allow for rotation and then eliminating most of the backlit fringe area, although at the expense of making it less pretty to some eyes.</td>', 'Nice but less abstract feeling than ideal. The current version is a good detail study of a zebra. The abstract pattern aspect might feel stronger if the original would allow for rotation and then eliminating most of the backlit fringe area, although at the expense of making it less pretty to some eyes.', '2008-08-30 22:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922273, 714694, 81362, '<td valign="top">I get a feeling that this would be more fun to watch mmoving and evolving in a video version instead of as a static piece. Must have been fun to see as you were capturing the image.</td>', 'I get a feeling that this would be more fun to watch mmoving and evolving in a video version instead of as a static piece. Must have been fun to see as you were capturing the image.', '2008-08-30 22:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922274, 714397, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice tribute. To help it be more abstract, I would consider eliminating the horizontal white element across the bottom.</td>', 'Nice tribute. To help it be more abstract, I would consider eliminating the horizontal white element across the bottom.', '2008-08-30 22:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922276, 713167, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice to see "*" large. Well seen and captured.</td>', 'Nice to see "*" large. Well seen and captured.', '2008-08-30 22:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922277, 713518, 83313, '<td valign="top">What the heck is it? This is as hard to figure out as my chrome lips in the EBay challenge.</td>', 'What the heck is it? This is as hard to figure out as my chrome lips in the EBay challenge.', '2008-08-30 22:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922279, 714578, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. The shallow DOF really adds to the softness of this image.</td>', 'Nice. The shallow DOF really adds to the softness of this image.', '2008-08-30 22:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922280, 713807, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice peaceful feeling, and good use of depth of field.</td>', 'Nice peaceful feeling, and good use of depth of field.', '2008-08-30 22:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922281, 713120, 81362, '<td valign="top">Shades of the Death Star battle scenes from Star Wars.</td>', 'Shades of the Death Star battle scenes from Star Wars.', '2008-08-30 22:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922282, 714513, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, shapes, shading, even if not especially abstract. 6.</td>', 'Nice tones, shapes, shading, even if not especially abstract. 6.', '2008-08-30 22:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922283, 714595, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of neat looking. A speaker cone?</td>', 'Kind of neat looking. A speaker cone?', '2008-08-30 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922286, 712811, 81362, '<td valign="top">Interesting collection of curves. Having a thin line border intersect with them that way doesn''t seem desirable.</td>', 'Interesting collection of curves. Having a thin line border intersect with them that way doesn''t seem desirable.', '2008-08-30 23:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922287, 714520, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very pretty bunch of curving shapes. I wonder if it would be a stronger image with the bright spot on the right cropped out (cloned out mabye even better, but not allowed in basic).</td>', 'Very pretty bunch of curving shapes. I wonder if it would be a stronger image with the bright spot on the right cropped out (cloned out mabye even better, but not allowed in basic).', '2008-08-30 23:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922289, 713563, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good choice for title, as it leads the imagination along the abstract path. Having a lot of the background blurred works well because so many of the foreground spheres are sharp.</td>', 'Good choice for title, as it leads the imagination along the abstract path. Having a lot of the background blurred works well because so many of the foreground spheres are sharp.', '2008-08-30 23:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922290, 713197, 81362, '<td valign="top">I once got a similar set of circles and curved shapes by shooting directly down the mount of a plastic water bottle. Nice lighting for most of the image. Having the center circle darker would have been interesting, although potentially very difficult to achieve (depending on what you had to work with).</td>', 'I once got a similar set of circles and curved shapes by shooting directly down the mount of a plastic water bottle. Nice lighting for most of the image. Having the center circle darker would have been interesting, although potentially very difficult to achieve (depending on what you had to work with).', '2008-08-30 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922291, 714281, 81362, '<td valign="top">Whether macro of fabric or a temporary gathering of the stars in the sky into squares, the diagonal composition meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Whether macro of fabric or a temporary gathering of the stars in the sky into squares, the diagonal composition meets the challenge well.', '2008-08-30 23:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922292, 714539, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good effort here. Golf balls catch the light and shadows in interesting ways. However, it seems a bit out of focus or soft throughout the whole image.</td>', 'A good effort here. Golf balls catch the light and shadows in interesting ways. However, it seems a bit out of focus or soft throughout the whole image.', '2008-08-30 23:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922293, 714490, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is about as abstract as you can get, I think. Interested to know what it really is.</td>', 'This is about as abstract as you can get, I think. Interested to know what it really is.', '2008-08-30 23:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922294, 713032, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bubbles always work well. Especially when they are nice and sharp like this.</td>', 'Bubbles always work well. Especially when they are nice and sharp like this.', '2008-08-30 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922338, 713704, 81362, '<td valign="top">I''m ranking this high, right up there with more clearly defined images. This echoes a style of abstract painting later than the impressionists, with a subtle oriental feeling tossed in for interest. I don''t get the title, but I like the image.</td>', 'I''m ranking this high, right up there with more clearly defined images. This echoes a style of abstract painting later than the impressionists, with a subtle oriental feeling tossed in for interest. I don''t get the title, but I like the image.', '2008-08-30 23:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922341, 712793, 81362, '<td valign="top">This would seem more abstract without the stand and cord as part of the image. Good macro and well composed portriat of a microphone.</td>', 'This would seem more abstract without the stand and cord as part of the image. Good macro and well composed portriat of a microphone.', '2008-08-30 23:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922343, 714031, 81362, '<td valign="top">Clever although not so abstract. Tilted horizon line and grain take away from the final product.</td>', 'Clever although not so abstract. Tilted horizon line and grain take away from the final product.', '2008-08-30 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922345, 713723, 81362, '<td valign="top">The sharp bright curves in the lower left contrast with the furry blur elsewhere. A different title might have left more room for the viewer''s imagination to work (folded angle wing, passing show girl in costume?) instead of landing on the concept of "cat" right away.</td>', 'The sharp bright curves in the lower left contrast with the furry blur elsewhere. A different title might have left more room for the viewer''s imagination to work (folded angle wing, passing show girl in costume?) instead of landing on the concept of "cat" right away.', '2008-08-30 23:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922348, 714148, 81362, '<td valign="top">Swirling turmoil of pasta (?) pretending to be flames. Very well done.</td>', 'Swirling turmoil of pasta (?) pretending to be flames. Very well done.', '2008-08-30 23:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922351, 713686, 81362, '<td valign="top">Your title makes me think of cake batter, the image texture in this B&amp;W conversion makes me think of rock formations in the southwest.</td>', 'Your title makes me think of cake batter, the image texture in this B&W conversion makes me think of rock formations in the southwest.', '2008-08-30 23:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922353, 714135, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very graphic. Hope you let us know how you got this.</td>', 'Very graphic. Hope you let us know how you got this.', '2008-08-30 23:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922356, 714233, 81362, '<td valign="top">Probably is more attractive in color, espeically if this is a flower as it appears on careful examination. Although hesitant to be so implite as to actually say so, I fear that  the black and white image (particularly with "hole" in the title) first looks like a lot of hair around a body opening.</td>', 'Probably is more attractive in color, espeically if this is a flower as it appears on careful examination. Although hesitant to be so implite as to actually say so, I fear that  the black and white image (particularly with "hole" in the title) first looks like a lot of hair around a body opening.', '2008-08-30 23:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922371, 714369, 81362, '<td valign="top">Similar to abstracts I''ve seen in modern art museum exhibits. Would love to hear how this image originated.</td>', 'Similar to abstracts I''ve seen in modern art museum exhibits. Would love to hear how this image originated.', '2008-08-30 23:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922372, 714568, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice set of repeating rectanglar shapes, and the trestle seems to do well with your choice of B&amp;W conversion. A little tighter crop, all sides but in particular removing the bright gravel (?) from the bottom of the picture might make the image more obviously abstract.</td>', 'Nice set of repeating rectanglar shapes, and the trestle seems to do well with your choice of B&W conversion. A little tighter crop, all sides but in particular removing the bright gravel (?) from the bottom of the picture might make the image more obviously abstract.', '2008-08-30 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922377, 712928, 81362, '<td valign="top">Something about this, maybe the symmetry and the pattern of contrasting tones, makes me give this a higher score than many of the other blurred entries. This feels full of motion, and tickles the imagination.</td>', 'Something about this, maybe the symmetry and the pattern of contrasting tones, makes me give this a higher score than many of the other blurred entries. This feels full of motion, and tickles the imagination.', '2008-08-30 23:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922382, 714523, 81362, '<td valign="top">The implied motion and repeated forms give this a pleasing dynamic. Nice depth of field for this degree of magnification.</td>', 'The implied motion and repeated forms give this a pleasing dynamic. Nice depth of field for this degree of magnification.', '2008-08-31 00:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922389, 714525, 47791, '<td valign="top">I tried the same thing. If you had gotten closer to the glass you might have had a better looking image.</td>', 'I tried the same thing. If you had gotten closer to the glass you might have had a better looking image.', '2008-08-31 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922393, 714658, 47791, '<td valign="top">A good attempt but Ive seen this executed better before. Without the background light it would have been better.</td>', 'A good attempt but Ive seen this executed better before. Without the background light it would have been better.', '2008-08-31 00:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922395, 714031, 47791, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Did you use two different shadows?</td>', 'Clever idea. Did you use two different shadows?', '2008-08-31 00:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922555, 714576, 57882, '<td valign="top">Smooth, silky and sharp.  I like the detail here.</td>', 'Smooth, silky and sharp.  I like the detail here.', '2008-08-31 01:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922565, 714377, 57882, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing.  I particularly like the soft lines.</td>', 'Mesmerizing.  I particularly like the soft lines.', '2008-08-31 01:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922567, 714031, 57882, '<td valign="top">Haunting.</td>', 'Haunting.', '2008-08-31 01:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922573, 714203, 97270, '<td valign="top">I can kind of see it is a reflection image...one that draws definite attention. The composition could have had a little more dramatic angle I feel. The white is almost balanced in the image which sort of take attention away from the center. I would still rate it pretty high because it does justice with the theme.. albeit it will be controversially abstract for some. Good job, could be better.</td>', 'I can kind of see it is a reflection image...one that draws definite attention. The composition could have had a little more dramatic angle I feel. The white is almost balanced in the image which sort of take attention away from the center. I would still rate it pretty high because it does justice with the theme.. albeit it will be controversially abstract for some. Good job, could be better.', '2008-08-31 01:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922599, 712601, 97270, '<td valign="top">Honestly, it is hard to relate the image to the title (indication). Still, the image has a strange glamor to it that draws attention to the two main areas. It is almost a hybrid between a metallic abstract and a dull mundane B/W close up. The moisture pattern is the strength of this image I think. The slightly out of focus (mesh?) pattern enhances the composition, but diminishes the abstraction. Perhaps the image would have been more powerful with the main pattern slightly off the center. Good job anyways, I am rating it close to a high score.</td>', 'Honestly, it is hard to relate the image to the title (indication). Still, the image has a strange glamor to it that draws attention to the two main areas. It is almost a hybrid between a metallic abstract and a dull mundane B/W close up. The moisture pattern is the strength of this image I think. The slightly out of focus (mesh?) pattern enhances the composition, but diminishes the abstraction. Perhaps the image would have been more powerful with the main pattern slightly off the center. Good job anyways, I am rating it close to a high score.', '2008-08-31 02:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922605, 714404, 97270, '<td valign="top">Extremely powerful abstraction. What is it, though?<br/> <br/>And this question adds to the strength to the image. Perhaps I wouldnt evenr want to know what it is as it might spoil the mystery. Perhaps moving the pattern a tad more off the center would create a more powerful visual.<br/> <br/>Good job, but can be better.</td>', 'Extremely powerful abstraction. What is it, though? And this question adds to the strength to the image. Perhaps I wouldnt evenr want to know what it is as it might spoil the mystery. Perhaps moving the pattern a tad more off the center would create a more powerful visual. Good job, but can be better.', '2008-08-31 02:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922613, 714057, 97270, '<td valign="top">Not abstract enough for me, sorry. When I look for abstraction, I look for a visual that takes my attention away from a recognizable subject.. one that stresses on form more than identity. The image conveys the title nicely, still missing the winner streak. I would rate it higher than average, closer to a high score, but can do better.</td>', 'Not abstract enough for me, sorry. When I look for abstraction, I look for a visual that takes my attention away from a recognizable subject.. one that stresses on form more than identity. The image conveys the title nicely, still missing the winner streak. I would rate it higher than average, closer to a high score, but can do better.', '2008-08-31 02:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922616, 714675, 97270, '<td valign="top">Oh what strong abstraction! There is no way the subject is recognized here.. yet such powerful form depiction! If I would look for two improvements here, it would be better contrast somehow, and a slightly off center composition. At present, the visual is right there.. in the center. There is no attention seeking or guiding patterns.<br/> <br/>Good job, can do better.. I am rating it close to a high score.</td>', 'Oh what strong abstraction! There is no way the subject is recognized here.. yet such powerful form depiction! If I would look for two improvements here, it would be better contrast somehow, and a slightly off center composition. At present, the visual is right there.. in the center. There is no attention seeking or guiding patterns. Good job, can do better.. I am rating it close to a high score.', '2008-08-31 02:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922621, 714492, 97270, '<td valign="top">The only reason I chopped off a high score for this picture is because I can identify the subjects in the image... not enough abstraction here. Still, it powerfully depicts the title. Another thing that could be better is the lighting.. the texture on the surfaces dont come up as powerfully as they could. Rated above average for this one.. closer to a high score.</td>', 'The only reason I chopped off a high score for this picture is because I can identify the subjects in the image... not enough abstraction here. Still, it powerfully depicts the title. Another thing that could be better is the lighting.. the texture on the surfaces dont come up as powerfully as they could. Rated above average for this one.. closer to a high score.', '2008-08-31 02:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922623, 713442, 97270, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture.. dont get me wrong. It just lacks originality for me. I am tired of seeing close ups of fluids mixing and dropping. I chopped off marks for these reasons:<br/> <br/> <br/>- lack of abstraction. What are you abstracting here (taking away form the picture in terms of struture)? I can easily see it is a kind of fluid... in action.<br/> <br/>- tecnically, the image looks noisy. I dont know if this is due to post processing, or poor lighting or sensor.<br/> <br/>- droplets again! Lack of originality.<br/> <br/>I am still rating this one above average because of the composition.</td>', 'This is a great picture.. dont get me wrong. It just lacks originality for me. I am tired of seeing close ups of fluids mixing and dropping. I chopped off marks for these reasons:  - lack of abstraction. What are you abstracting here (taking away form the picture in terms of struture)? I can easily see it is a kind of fluid... in action. - tecnically, the image looks noisy. I dont know if this is due to post processing, or poor lighting or sensor. - droplets again! Lack of originality. I am still rating this one above average because of the composition.', '2008-08-31 02:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922624, 712675, 97270, '<td valign="top">If this is a floral pattern, I would love to find out which one. Very impressive macro. The only reasons I am deducting marks here are because:<br/> <br/>- without reading the title, one cant deduce the maning of the picture. The abstraction is weak.<br/> <br/>- the composition is straightforward.. no visual tricks to lead you to the subject. It could have been more interesting.<br/> <br/>Good job!!</td>', 'If this is a floral pattern, I would love to find out which one. Very impressive macro. The only reasons I am deducting marks here are because: - without reading the title, one cant deduce the maning of the picture. The abstraction is weak. - the composition is straightforward.. no visual tricks to lead you to the subject. It could have been more interesting. Good job!!', '2008-08-31 02:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
