(4922934, 713936, 92024, '<td valign="top">This photo looks amazing. The reflected corrugated roof looks really cool to me, but for some reason the original (which I suppose has to be there for the reflection to make sense) makes me feel uncomfortable. It seems to mess with the vertical lines in such a way as to change the atmosphere.</td>', 'This photo looks amazing. The reflected corrugated roof looks really cool to me, but for some reason the original (which I suppose has to be there for the reflection to make sense) makes me feel uncomfortable. It seems to mess with the vertical lines in such a way as to change the atmosphere.', '2008-08-31 11:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922936, 713558, 92024, '<td valign="top">Splendid composition. I think the border decision was cool because otherwise the blacks and whites would''ve looked a bit soft.</td>', 'Splendid composition. I think the border decision was cool because otherwise the blacks and whites would''ve looked a bit soft.', '2008-08-31 11:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4922959, 714449, 92024, '<td valign="top">Enjoyed this photo. Last ball in the foreground on the left strikes me as out of place, don''t know exactly why. Think foreground and background symmetry by cropping it out might''ve made me feel better. But then I''m not sure my feelings matter very much...</td>', 'Enjoyed this photo. Last ball in the foreground on the left strikes me as out of place, don''t know exactly why. Think foreground and background symmetry by cropping it out might''ve made me feel better. But then I''m not sure my feelings matter very much...', '2008-08-31 11:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4923138, 713934, 90414, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but am not sure what makes it abstract vs. still life.</td>', 'I like this shot, but am not sure what makes it abstract vs. still life.', '2008-08-31 14:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4923139, 713141, 90414, '<td valign="top">Quite abstract to me, but also too oof for my taste. Nice b/w range.</td>', 'Quite abstract to me, but also too oof for my taste. Nice b/w range.', '2008-08-31 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4923142, 712675, 90414, '<td valign="top">A strong composition for abstract due to the array of different lines and angles.</td>', 'A strong composition for abstract due to the array of different lines and angles.', '2008-08-31 14:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4923144, 714636, 90414, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what it is, but it makes a compelling photo imo.</td>', 'I have no idea what it is, but it makes a compelling photo imo.', '2008-08-31 14:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4923147, 714637, 90414, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the background is oversharpened, or if that is reflection of lighting, but it overpowers the milk for me. On the plus side, the flow of milk does look a lot like Benjamin Franklin...</td>', 'Not sure if the background is oversharpened, or if that is reflection of lighting, but it overpowers the milk for me. On the plus side, the flow of milk does look a lot like Benjamin Franklin...', '2008-08-31 14:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
