(4923152, 713380, 90414, '<td valign="top">Cropped too closely at the top for me, but nice photo. The range of geometric shapes truly make it abstract imo.</td>', 'Cropped too closely at the top for me, but nice photo. The range of geometric shapes truly make it abstract imo.', '2008-08-31 14:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
