(4923197, 714490, 75532, '<td valign="top">the image is compelling, and the title just keeps me guessing at what it is a vase? a body? feet? 8</td>', 'the image is compelling, and the title just keeps me guessing at what it is a vase? a body? feet? 8', '2008-08-31 15:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
