(4927696, 714230, 97166, '<td valign="top">Although definitely abstract, and certianly shot extremely well on a technical level, there''s a kind of generic feel about this shot that keeps me from giving this a higher score.  There''s also something about the lines that <b>fight</b> each other, rather than work together.  I think, "I like this." but then I find I immediately follow it with, "but not that much."</td>', 'Although definitely abstract, and certianly shot extremely well on a technical level, there''s a kind of generic feel about this shot that keeps me from giving this a higher score.  There''s also something about the lines that fight each other, rather than work together.  I think, "I like this." but then I find I immediately follow it with, "but not that much."', '2008-09-02 12:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927697, 712762, 97166, '<td valign="top">This is a truly brilliant art piece that would look fantastic hanging just about anywhere.</td>', 'This is a truly brilliant art piece that would look fantastic hanging just about anywhere.', '2008-09-02 12:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927700, 714577, 97166, '<td valign="top">You''ve used minimalism to nice effect here.   Personally, I''d have liked to have seen a stronger stretch effect on the circular object, rendering it more oblong and giving the piece a little more sense of movement.</td>', 'You''ve used minimalism to nice effect here.   Personally, I''d have liked to have seen a stronger stretch effect on the circular object, rendering it more oblong and giving the piece a little more sense of movement.', '2008-09-02 12:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927701, 713552, 97166, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of a shallow DOF to render a common subject into a more abstractive work.  Perhaps a little too much on the top, placing the focal subject too near the framing for my tastes, but nicely done otherwise.</td>', 'Very nice use of a shallow DOF to render a common subject into a more abstractive work.  Perhaps a little too much on the top, placing the focal subject too near the framing for my tastes, but nicely done otherwise.', '2008-09-02 12:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927703, 712793, 97166, '<td valign="top">Good use of macro to try and give a common item an abstractive feel.</td>', 'Good use of macro to try and give a common item an abstractive feel.', '2008-09-02 12:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927706, 714602, 97166, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shallow DOF. You''ve rendered a nice abstractive theme here, although the line of focus doesn''t really stand out enough I think.  Or perhaps it stands out too much.  Either way, something about it unbalances things just that tiny bit.</td>', 'Nice use of shallow DOF. You''ve rendered a nice abstractive theme here, although the line of focus doesn''t really stand out enough I think.  Or perhaps it stands out too much.  Either way, something about it unbalances things just that tiny bit.', '2008-09-02 13:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
