(4927718, 713191, 97166, '<td valign="top">My hatred for water-drops takes a back seat to the gorgeous use of the splatter.  However, <b>without</b> the water-drops, I''d have been inclined to bump you up 2 or more points.</td>', 'My hatred for water-drops takes a back seat to the gorgeous use of the splatter.  However, without the water-drops, I''d have been inclined to bump you up 2 or more points.', '2008-09-02 13:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
