(4928583, 712792, 97166, '<td valign="top">I was wondering how many body-form abstracts we''d see in this challenge. So far, this is the only one. A couple of things keep it from being a really good photo though. One is a lack of uniform focus, which serves to point out the glaring flaws in the wall behind the subject.  The lighting is also still a bit flat, not allowing your shapes to play for me like I''d like.</td>', 'I was wondering how many body-form abstracts we''d see in this challenge. So far, this is the only one. A couple of things keep it from being a really good photo though. One is a lack of uniform focus, which serves to point out the glaring flaws in the wall behind the subject.  The lighting is also still a bit flat, not allowing your shapes to play for me like I''d like.', '2008-09-02 19:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
