(4928846, 714148, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s abstract alright. Great job with the lighting. Few nitpicks, There''s a cut off near the bottom left side of the sclupture. I can also see some image noise in the top right corner. Boosting the contrast for a pitch black background would''ve blown the hightlights. I suggest using the Selective Color dialog and darkening the black through there. It''ll leave the hightlights alone.<br/>(no vote)</td>', 'It''s abstract alright. Great job with the lighting. Few nitpicks, There''s a cut off near the bottom left side of the sclupture. I can also see some image noise in the top right corner. Boosting the contrast for a pitch black background would''ve blown the hightlights. I suggest using the Selective Color dialog and darkening the black through there. It''ll leave the hightlights alone.(no vote)', '2008-09-02 21:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
