(4928903, 713936, 29011, '<td valign="top">I really like the look of this shot but cant help wonder if a tighter crop would''ve lent itself better toward this specific challenge theme.  Using the rule of thirds for the crop, by chopping off the left side and some of the top to get rid of any bits showing of the small top windows.<br/>(no vote)</td>', 'I really like the look of this shot but cant help wonder if a tighter crop would''ve lent itself better toward this specific challenge theme.  Using the rule of thirds for the crop, by chopping off the left side and some of the top to get rid of any bits showing of the small top windows.(no vote)', '2008-09-02 22:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
