(4928945, 713393, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the texture. Nicely exposed, the tones and contrast look very good. As for cropping, perhaps a little to get rid of the little triangle space off of the bottom left corner. (no vote)</td>', 'Great capture of the texture. Nicely exposed, the tones and contrast look very good. As for cropping, perhaps a little to get rid of the little triangle space off of the bottom left corner. (no vote)', '2008-09-02 22:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4928964, 713558, 29011, '<td valign="top">This should do well. It''s nice and clear and not oversharpened. I have seen another shot of this building and like the straight on composition here. Perhaps a suggestion to darken the shadows a bit, so the lines stand out more, but it''s a very minor nitpick if it is at all. (no vote)</td>', 'This should do well. It''s nice and clear and not oversharpened. I have seen another shot of this building and like the straight on composition here. Perhaps a suggestion to darken the shadows a bit, so the lines stand out more, but it''s a very minor nitpick if it is at all. (no vote)', '2008-09-02 22:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4928966, 713032, 59276, '<td valign="top">imo....I might have used a square crop or used negative space by setting the glass in the upper right corner. still very good idea</td>', 'imo....I might have used a square crop or used negative space by setting the glass in the upper right corner. still very good idea', '2008-09-02 22:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
