(4929672, 714135, 29486, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I can''t seem to change my Photographer''s Comments anymore. For those who want to know what this is...it''s a Screen Door. I was riding around my neighborhood on my bike when I saw it and knew it would be perfect. The only adjustment was a slight Levels to make the white white and the black black. Once again I seem to be penalized for thinking outside the box. It''s Abstract, Black and White, and it''s fairly cool looking. I didn''t expect to break 6 on it but 5.1! 6 1''s and 9 2''s and 12 3''s! Clearly people thought I was faking a photo.</td>', 'Hmmm. I can''t seem to change my Photographer''s Comments anymore. For those who want to know what this is...it''s a Screen Door. I was riding around my neighborhood on my bike when I saw it and knew it would be perfect. The only adjustment was a slight Levels to make the white white and the black black. Once again I seem to be penalized for thinking outside the box. It''s Abstract, Black and White, and it''s fairly cool looking. I didn''t expect to break 6 on it but 5.1! 6 1''s and 9 2''s and 12 3''s! Clearly people thought I was faking a photo.', '2008-09-03 01:33:17.000000', NULL, 0),
