(4929829, 713485, 45652, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96957" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Oich</a>: Thanks! :) And I''m surprised this is my best achievement here! :) Technically it could have been much better, too much noise (although I wanted to have some), blurry on the edges, and as <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=49109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">eyewave</a> points out, maybe I should have tilted it a bit to have 45 degree angle on the lines. Seems that I really need to find out more time to execute my shots. I think that''s my biggest problem currently...</td>', ' Oich: Thanks! :) And I''m surprised this is my best achievement here! :) Technically it could have been much better, too much noise (although I wanted to have some), blurry on the edges, and as  eyewave points out, maybe I should have tilted it a bit to have 45 degree angle on the lines. Seems that I really need to find out more time to execute my shots. I think that''s my biggest problem currently...', '2008-09-03 02:05:16.000000', NULL, 0),
