(4929966, 713563, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>Just wonderful!  And finally a use for those paperweights! Seriously, technically superb, wonderful abstraction, endlessly interesting</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!Just wonderful!  And finally a use for those paperweights! Seriously, technically superb, wonderful abstraction, endlessly interesting', '2008-09-03 02:35:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929978, 714139, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>I love this one.  Some might say it could benefit from a bit more contrast--I find myself going back and forth on that: there are no shortage of high contrast images in b/w photography in general, and this subject has so many subtle mid-tones that I think it is probably best just as is.  Who am I to question your vision anyway?  The nerve I would have, if I did so!!</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!I love this one.  Some might say it could benefit from a bit more contrast--I find myself going back and forth on that: there are no shortage of high contrast images in b/w photography in general, and this subject has so many subtle mid-tones that I think it is probably best just as is.  Who am I to question your vision anyway?  The nerve I would have, if I did so!!', '2008-09-03 02:39:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929987, 714510, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous</a> already said it best: "compelling"</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee! Posthumous already said it best: "compelling"', '2008-09-03 02:40:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929990, 714122, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>You got any genetic connection to Brett Weston?  This is stunning and superb.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!You got any genetic connection to Brett Weston?  This is stunning and superb.', '2008-09-03 02:41:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929997, 713167, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>Thanks for showing me something I have never seen, in such a beautiful and luminous way.  I think maybe I don''t even want to know "what" this is, as the mystery adds so much....</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!Thanks for showing me something I have never seen, in such a beautiful and luminous way.  I think maybe I don''t even want to know "what" this is, as the mystery adds so much....', '2008-09-03 02:42:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929998, 712762, 84520, '<td valign="top">Yes!  One of, if not the only true abstract shot that was both original and nearly flawless in technical execution.  I had this pegged for the blue--congrats!!</td>', 'Yes!  One of, if not the only true abstract shot that was both original and nearly flawless in technical execution.  I had this pegged for the blue--congrats!!', '2008-09-03 02:42:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4930003, 713491, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>This is exceptionally well done, and the variation in tone/luminance from quadrant to quadrant is spectacular.  If had this print in front of me, I would enjoy rotating it around and seeing the different impact each 90 degrees brings....</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!This is exceptionally well done, and the variation in tone/luminance from quadrant to quadrant is spectacular.  If had this print in front of me, I would enjoy rotating it around and seeing the different impact each 90 degrees brings....', '2008-09-03 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
