(4930377, 714404, 67237, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nutzito:</b></div><hr/><i> Amongst the many Irene imitations, this is one of the least accomplished...a bit too much noise in the background, several imperfections in the paper border, asymmetric white(?) line to the frame, etc, etc. The picture deserves a 5 from me, minus 1 point for trying to copy Irene = 4 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Congrats for the result Irene. I still think this is not at the level of your usual work though. Never mind, just keep on "copying" yourself ;-D<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-03 05:06:52.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by nutzito: Amongst the many Irene imitations, this is one of the least accomplished...a bit too much noise in the background, several imperfections in the paper border, asymmetric white(?) line to the frame, etc, etc. The picture deserves a 5 from me, minus 1 point for trying to copy Irene = 4   Congrats for the result Irene. I still think this is not at the level of your usual work though. Never mind, just keep on "copying" yourself ;-D', '2008-09-03 06:06:08.000000', '2008-09-03 06:06:52.000000', 0),
(4930379, 712762, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great work. Congrats on your Blue</td>', 'Great work. Congrats on your Blue', '2008-09-03 06:07:44.000000', NULL, 0),
