(4936561, 714683, 75781, '<td valign="top">Thanks Chaimelle, abstracts usually do pretty sucky on dpc.  But thanks for the comment.<br/> <br/>whats funny is that greyscale by definition IS black &amp; white. Not only that it was a color image and I did a photoshop channel mixer to black and white on it.  <br/> <br/>Just another case of a dumb person on DPC challege who looks at a photo for 3 seconds and makes a judgement.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-05 14:39:27.</i></td>', 'Thanks Chaimelle, abstracts usually do pretty sucky on dpc.  But thanks for the comment. whats funny is that greyscale by definition IS black & white. Not only that it was a color image and I did a photoshop channel mixer to black and white on it.   Just another case of a dumb person on DPC challege who looks at a photo for 3 seconds and makes a judgement.', '2008-09-05 15:39:02.000000', '2008-09-05 15:39:27.000000', 0),
