(4944258, 713640, 42495, '<td valign="top">This is certainly abstract and B&amp;W so it met the challenge description.  To create a stronger image, you may want to soften the light a bit to get rid of the shadows and reflections.  Also, if you were to come in a lot closer and just use a small portion of the cape that may make it even more abstract.  But considering it''s a 7" Jareth the Goblin King (?) cape, you may be at your camera''s limits.</td>', 'This is certainly abstract and B&W so it met the challenge description.  To create a stronger image, you may want to soften the light a bit to get rid of the shadows and reflections.  Also, if you were to come in a lot closer and just use a small portion of the cape that may make it even more abstract.  But considering it''s a 7" Jareth the Goblin King (?) cape, you may be at your camera''s limits.', '2008-09-09 11:56:42.000000', NULL, 0),
